// Diagnostic only: no real cryptography, credentials, or file writes.
Add_Dynamic_Module Security Test
Security Debug True
Security Set_Paths Resources
Security Generate_Key
Security Encrypt diagnostic-payload diagnostic-key
Security Decrypt diagnostic-cipher diagnostic-key
Security Encrypt_With_Password diagnostic-payload diagnostic-password
Security Decrypt_With_Password diagnostic-cipher diagnostic-password
Security Encrypt_File Input.bin Output.enc diagnostic-key
Security Decrypt_File Output.enc Restored.bin diagnostic-key
Security Encrypt_File_With_Password Input.bin Output.enc diagnostic-password
Security Decrypt_File_With_Password Output.enc Restored.bin diagnostic-password
Security Backend_Version
Security Last_Error
Print SECURITY_TEST_PASSED
Done
